<!-- PROCESS -->
<section style="padding:76px 24px;background:#EEF3F1;">
  <div style="max-width:1020px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">How It Works</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);margin:0 0 44px;">Three Steps: Tell Us, Get a Quote, Book the Surveyor.</h2>
    <div class="steps-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#1E6F63;color:#fff;font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">1</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#111418;margin:0 0 10px;">Enquiry and a plain-English chat</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Call or send the form and tell us the address, what's happening (a fence, a design, a purchase, a split) and what anyone has asked you for. That's usually enough to work out which kind of survey fits.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#1E6F63;color:#fff;font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">2</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#111418;margin:0 0 10px;">Introduction, site visit and scope</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">We introduce an independent Licensed Surveyor, who looks at your title and the block and sets the scope. Check the surveyor's licence on the Surveyors Board register before you agree to anything.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#1E6F63;color:#fff;font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">3</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#111418;margin:0 0 10px;">Quote and delivery, direct with the surveyor</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">The surveyor quotes you directly and carries out the work. Ask for what the survey covers, what you receive at the end and when, in writing, before you say yes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
